WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.300
The mouth is the most accessible window into the rest of your body, and the earliest place to intervene.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.400
That is why we built the Primary iD Membership.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.400
It starts at home. Your Primary iD scores five areas of your health, so you know where you stand before you walk in.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.000
At your first visit, one 3D scan shows your jaws, your airway and your sinuses.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.600
Things a flat X-ray can't show.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.400
Software reads every X-ray with me, as a second set of eyes, so small problems are found while they are still small.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.400
A digital scan builds a model of your mouth in minutes. You see your teeth the way I do.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:48.400
A saliva test names the bacteria you carry. That matters, because gum disease is linked to heart disease and diabetes.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Then we sit down together. You leave with a plan, and the price of everything on it.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:59.600
Catch a cavity early, and we may be able to help the enamel rebuild itself. No needle, no drill.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.600
Straighten your teeth with clear aligners, made to be worn only at night.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:11.400
And we look beyond the mouth, with member pricing on lab work, sleep testing and microbiome testing.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.600
Every year, we repeat the full look, so you can see what changed.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:21.600
$499 a year. Every price published in advance. Start with your iD.
